      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense from an investment standpoint. So if I'm looking at a specific district that's currently majority white but is seeing a rapid increase in minority populations, would you generally recommend selling off assets there before the decline hits, or is the 'stability' of the existing demographic enough to hold value?",
